      <title>Turkey fails in challenge to billion-dollar Iraq oil award</title>
      <link>https://globalarbitrationreview.com/article/turkey-fails-in-challenge-billion-dollar-iraq-oil-award</link>
      <description>The Paris Court of Appeal has refused Turkey’s bid to partially annul an ICC award issued in a multibillion-dollar dispute with Iraq over crude oil exports, in which both states claim to be the net award creditor.</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://globalarbitrationreview.com/article/turkey-fails-in-challenge-billion-dollar-iraq-oil-award</guid>
