    <item>
      <title>Venezuela unseats Hobér in Lufthansa case at PCA</title>
      <link>https://globalarbitrationreview.com/article/venezuela-unseats-hober-in-lufthansa-case-pca</link>
      <description>Swedish arbitrator Kaj Hobér has been disqualified from hearing German airline Lufthansa’s US$280 million treaty claim against Venezuela at the Permanent Court of Arbitration for failing to disclose his role as counsel in a “landmark case” over a most-favoured nation clause.</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://globalarbitrationreview.com/article/venezuela-unseats-hober-in-lufthansa-case-pca</guid>
      <enclosure url="https://d2qu5xmcgmzxnb.cloudfront." length="0" type="image/jpeg"/>
