      <title>Singaporean arbitrator resigns after criticism by India’s top court</title>
      <link>https://globalarbitrationreview.com/article/singaporean-arbitrator-resigns-after-criticism-indias-top-court</link>
      <description>Rajah &amp;amp; Tann’s Andre Yeap SC has resigned as arbitrator in a high-profile ICC case over an Omani border security system after reportedly being criticised by India’s Supreme Court for failing to disclose a prior appointment by a related party.</description>
